{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_018cUYi1gjtQyKUx8GMSmkBz", "type": "tool_result", "content": "1\t---\n2\tversion: 2\n3\tid: 01a0f787-5130-7003-ac94-cf8f6a87d337\n4\ttype: hazard\n5\tstatus: Active\n6\ttitle: Never edit an applied migration\n7\t---\n8\t\n9\t# Never edit an applied migration\n10\t\n11\t**Summary:** Never edit an applied migration\n12\t\n13\t## Content\n14\t\n15\tFiles in migrations/ are applied in production. Never edit one; add a new file with the next 4-digit number, e.g. `0008_fix_customers.sql`.\n16\t\n17\t## Scope\n18\t\n19\t- **Files:** `migrations/`\n20\t- **Tags:** `database`, `migrations`\n21\t- **Criticality:** 0.5\n22\t- **Confidence:** 0.8\n23\t\n24\t## Provenance\n25\t\n26\t- **Source:** human\n27\t- **Created:** 2026-10-01T12:53:55.632859634+00:00\n28\t- **Updated:** 2026-10-01T12:53:55.632859634+00:00\n29\t\n30\t<!-- engramdb\n31\tvisibility: Shared\n32\taccessed_at: 2026-10-01T12:53:55.632859634Z\n33\tdecay:\n34\t  strategy: none\n35\t  floor: 0.5\n36\t-->\n37\t"}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "d94a5312-2542-4bad-9797-262daebadcac", "uuid": "448d4fa0-27d7-4841-9b58-a8bd54bbdb80", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T12:54:13.336Z", "tool_use_result": {"type": "text", "file": {"filePath": "/tmp/mte-pq-migration-bbqi1ive/ledgerline/.engramdb/memories/never-edit-an-applied-migration_01a0f787-5130-7003-ac94-cf8f6a87d337.md", "content": "---\nversion: 2\nid: 01a0f787-5130-7003-ac94-cf8f6a87d337\ntype: hazard\nstatus: Active\ntitle: Never edit an applied migration\n---\n\n# Never edit an applied migration\n\n**Summary:** Never edit an applied migration\n\n## Content\n\nFiles in migrations/ are applied in production. Never edit one; add a new file with the next 4-digit number, e.g. `0008_fix_customers.sql`.\n\n## Scope\n\n- **Files:** `migrations/`\n- **Tags:** `database`, `migrations`\n- **Criticality:** 0.5\n- **Confidence:** 0.8\n\n## Provenance\n\n- **Source:** human\n- **Created:** 2026-